{"id":"c35dc6c3143a8724","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-scott.md","title":"Scott","display":"df-scott — Scott","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-scott","aliases":["58-df-scott","Scott"],"display":"df-scott — Scott","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-scott"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-scott</span><span>Scott</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-scott — Scott"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\leq\\in V\\land U\\subseteq D\">\\(D,\\leq\\in V\\land U\\subseteq D\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md\">../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ScottOpen}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ScottOpen}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (Scott-open predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott}\\vdash \\operatorname{ScottOpen}_S(U,D,\\leq)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{PartOrd}(D,\\leq)\\land U\\subseteq D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in D\\;(x\\leq y\\to y\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;\\forall s\\in D\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(x\\leq z\\land y\\leq z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\leq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;\\bigl((\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\leq u))\\to s\\leq u\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to X\\cap U\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott}\\vdash \\operatorname{ScottOpen}_S(U,D,\\leq)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{PartOrd}(D,\\leq)\\land U\\subseteq D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in D\\;(x\\leq y\\to y\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;\\forall s\\in D\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(x\\leq z\\land y\\leq z)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\leq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;\\bigl((\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\leq u))\\to s\\leq u\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in U\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to X\\cap U\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Directedness and the least-upper-bound condition are expanded using the supplied order relation, so no hidden supremum operator is assumed.</li>\n<li>Scott domains support denotational semantics and models of recursive types.</li>\n<li>CPO: complete partial order; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists \\sup\">\\(\\exists \\sup\\)</span> of directed sets; least element <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-algebraic: compact elements are countable; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall d \\in D, \\downarrow d = \\bigcup \\downarrow k\">\\(\\forall d \\in D, \\downarrow d = \\bigcup \\downarrow k\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k \\leq d\">\\(k \\leq d\\)</span></li>\n<li>Continuous functions: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: D \\to D\">\\(f: D \\to D\\)</span> continuous <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff f\">\\(\\iff f\\)</span> preserves sup of directed sets</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Abramsky and Gabbay, Handbook of Logic in Computer Science</li>\n<li>Scott, Domains for Denotational Semantics</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\subseteq V^2$ (partial-order predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\leq\\in V\\land U\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ScottOpen}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}scott}\\vdash \\operatorname{ScottOpen}_S(U,D,\\leq)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{PartOrd}(D,\\leq)\\land U\\subseteq D\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall y\\in D\\;(x\\leq y\\to y\\in U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\subseteq D\\;\\forall s\\in D\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(x\\leq z\\land y\\leq z)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\leq s)\n\\land\\forall u\\in D\\;\\bigl((\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\leq u))\\to s\\leq u\\bigr)\n\\land s\\in U\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\to X\\cap U\\neq\\varnothing\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists \\sup","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall d \\in D, \\downarrow d = \\bigcup \\downarrow k","display":false},{"tex":"k \\leq d","display":false},{"tex":"f: D \\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\iff f","display":false}],"bytes":1694,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-scott]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-scott.md|58-df-scott]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["83dfbde66bc78255"]}